{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2021-08-20 08:00:00', 'title': 'DANAHER ANNOUNCES PASSING OF FORMER PRESIDENT & CEO, GEORGE M. SHERMAN', 'text': "WASHINGTON, AUG. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR) ANNOUNCED THAT GEORGE M. SHERMAN, THE COMPANY'S PRESIDENT & CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER DURING THE YEARS 1990-2001, DIED EARLIER THIS WEEK AFTER AN ILLNESS."}